* ''Faces name themselves at creation'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"Faces name themselves at creation"//). A face's label (relation -> pet-name) lands the moment the face stands, so a seed after a re-founding adopts its folders by that name with no door having read the face first. Landed on the node (the founding, `found-hearth.ts`; `lares persona`, `persona.ts`). The browser writes the label at its founding too, into OPFS (`browser-face-labels.ts`, one shared seam with the node).

